OL,3,ANigerian monarch, 92, suspended after  
OL,4,Asexual assault claims                  
OL,6,FOne of Nigeria's best-known monarchs,  
OL,7,Fthe Emir of Daura, has been suspended  
OL,8,Ffrom all official engagements and      
OL,9,Ftravel following allegations of sexual 
OL,10,Fassault by a Polish tourist.           
OL,12,FThe visitor said Umar Farouk Umar, 92, 
OL,13,Fhad grabbed her chest during a tourism 
OL,14,Fencounter and that she felt disgusted  
OL,15,Fby the experience.                     
OL,17,FThe allegation sparked widespread      
OL,18,Fdiscussion across social media         
OL,19,Fplatforms, with many calling for the   
OL,20,Fsuspension of the emir and an          
OL,21,Finvestigation - calls the Katsina state
OL,22,Fgovernment has now heeded.             
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
